ing of materials.\nPhenom-World is based in the high-tech region of Eindhoven in The Netherlands. This strategic position and partners give Phenom-World access to the newest technologies and best resources for developing state-of-the-art equipment and applications. With representatives in more than 40 countries and a fast-growing installed base, we are committed to supporting our customers with a highly skilled team of specialists.", "short_description": "Phenom-World is globally the yearly number 1 manufacturer of desktop scanning electron microscopes and imaging and analysis packages required in a large variety of applications. The Phenom desktop SEM is known worldwide for its ease-of-use, speed and reliability.\n\nWith representatives in more than 40 countries and a fast-growing installed base, we are committed to supporting our customers with our highly skilled team of specialists who provide application and service support on a global scale. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.phenom-world.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.phenom-world.com/", "publisher_name": "Phenom World", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.phenom-world.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "904649030225682"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1939676546260476"}]}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1489597200,